WEBVTT

00:00:00.107 --> 00:00:05.195
This video shows how a student uses the AI Study Helper on a phone.

00:00:06.865 --> 00:00:17.545
Tap the menu button and choose AI Study Helper. It is a tutor that knows your class and subjects. The welcome screen lists some questions to try.

00:00:21.329 --> 00:00:30.761
Tap one of the suggestions, for example Help me understand fractions. Your question appears on the right and the answer comes back below it.

00:00:41.391 --> 00:00:46.887
Or type your own question in the box at the bottom, then tap the arrow button to send it.

00:01:05.202 --> 00:01:15.786
The box counts your characters, up to 2000 for one message. You can send up to 30 messages a day, and your chat is saved so you can come back to it.

00:01:16.633 --> 00:01:24.241
Tap Clear Chat at the top to delete the conversation. The welcome screen comes back and you can start fresh.

00:01:36.887 --> 00:01:43.031
That is the AI Study Helper. It only answers questions about your studies.
